| NaN/Inf results | 1. Check division by zero<br>2. Verify numerical stability<br>3. Add bounds checking |
| Mismatched shapes | 1. Print tensor shapes<br>2. Check dimension calculations<br>3. Verify reduction logic |

### Performance Issues
